LanguageData.LP_GenieWish.description:
Ask the genie to grant a wish (a choice window pops up):
Harvest: every crop on the map ripens at once;
Peace: no hostile raids land on this map for 15 days;
Healing: heals the wounds and diseases of all colonists on the map (addictions excluded);
Wealth: 2000 silver appears at the genie's feet;
Clear sky: the weather clears and stays that way for 5 days;
Epiphany: each colonist gets +2 levels in a random skill.
Cooldown 60 days; canceling in the choice window doesn't use the cooldown. After a wish the genie is weary for 15 days: work speed halved, bloodline abilities unavailable, mood -5.
